# DXMT's headless programs for the 4b-2 gate (gate.sh): name|exe|arguments|prefixes. The arguments are those of
# dxmt/check.sh's first `run ours` line for the program; @T is the tests folder (dxmt/tests, or its copy in the VM
# share) and @S its shaders, which each side passes as Z: paths. A line of output is compared when it starts with one
# of the program's prefixes (its own printf lines; Wine's, DXMT's and the launcher's never count).
d3d11_vsia|d3d11_vsia.exe||d3d11
d3d12_api|d3d12_api.exe|@S/depth.vs.dxil @S/depth.ps.dxil|library residency nulldsv multifence markers list1 heap1 feature caps cachedblob map
