d3d12_cache|d3d12_cache.exe|@S/cache.vs.dxil @S/cache.ps.dxil @S/cache.cs.dxil a|cache timing
d3d12_compress|d3d12_compress.exe||compress
d3d12_copy|d3d12_copy.exe||copy
d3d12_depth|d3d12_depth.exe|@S/depth.vs.dxil @S/depth.ps.dxil @S/depth.psdepth.dxil|depth
d3d12_dxil|d3d12_dxil.exe|@S/triangle.vs.dxil @S/triangle.ps.dxil @S/compute.cs.dxil @T/dxil/reject/gatherraw.dxil|graphics device compute canary
d3d12_dxil_exec|d3d12_dxil_exec.exe|@T/dxil|group threads
d3d12_hazards|d3d12_hazards.exe|@S|hazard ts-many
d3d12_indirect|d3d12_indirect.exe|@S/indirect.vs.dxil @S/indirect.ps.dxil @S/indirect.cs.dxil @S/indirect.vsid.dxil @S/indirect.psid.dxil @S/indirect.vsvid.dxil @S/indirect.vsstart.dxil|indirect
